THIRD_RECALL = 'You are reconciling two auditors\' lists. Read the packet and both lists, check the records yourself, and\noutput the single complete list: keep items that the records support, drop items they do not, add items both missed.\nOutput only {"packet_id": "<id>", "items": [...]} in the same item format. You have not been shown any extraction.'

